{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Qualify the public containment guarantee.** This states that factory failures never disrupt execution, but `PluginRunner` intentionally propagates `VirtualMachineError` and `ThreadDeath`. Document that only non-fatal failures and null results are skipped, and apply the same wording to `withPlugins`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74nskr","finding_digest":"c1c08f743b11cd85602c767a46e583502d4c1bce22be1061b15be353f22ab0a6","finding_id":"arf_v1_yhai65b3chgykybmoz5enzmdka","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/durableexecutionpluginfactory::failure-contract::fatal-exception-qualification","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/durableexecutionpluginfactory::failure-contract::fatal-exception-qualification","line":17,"observation_digest":"a13b21d529217963b9d5216991f4e0bb66bc26ec4d8abed9ecd169c30d4276d4","observation_id":"aro_v1_ue5sdvjjef4whoovefuzd5haxn","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/DurableExecutionPluginFactory.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T01:40:50Z","review_id":"arr_v1_obth4iyaj7ebllsk2q4fq2hrdn","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"9ec15bef9250b997ce9bcd2778478b350b5d7bc5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":16,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_q3gwvag2i6mg7jrw735onwtkjy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T01:40:50Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
